From fd20acd7ed525da5989ae8e7de036b0b147af054 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LPFchan <me@lost.plus>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:19:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 02/47] Inkling decode: latency-bound mix and quant kernels
 issue all loads at once; NVFP4 drafter projections under FP4=all

tf_ik_mix: one 576-thread CTA a row, each thread one 16-byte chunk of every source, one combined
reduction (50 -> 14 us). tf_ik_quant: one thread a 16-value group (29 -> 13 us), same per-group math.
TF_INKLING_FP4=all also packs the DSpark drafter's attention and MLP projections as NVFP4.

Spark pair, greedy: plain 22.3 -> 24.8 tok/s; with DRAFTS=1 code 39 tok/s, prose 26-28 tok/s.
