From 5e78983ae6cdd3a423f552aa9813dcfce22722ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LPFchan <me@lost.plus>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:23:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 16/47] inkling2: TF_INKLING_EDIT, OpenUncensored's refusal
 edit for requests that ask (TENSORFOLD_KEYS_MODEL)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

y -= s E (Eᵀ y) on each edited layer's summed attention and MoE outputs, one small kernel a site, launched only
for streams that take the edit; they replay graphs of their own, so the stock model's launches and bits are
unchanged. Rank 1 learns the choice from the begin record.
