 zig/kernels/cuda/prompt16.cu | 34 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/zig/kernels/cuda/prompt16.cu b/zig/kernels/cuda/prompt16.cu
