 rotates its eight slots in one CTA (tf_ik_quant then tf_ik_rotate's
 arithmetic in order; passes under 64 rows keep the two kernels, bits
 unchanged)

---
 zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2_exl3.cuh    | 41 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
